# Corpora are fetched on demand by ./scripts/fetch-corpora.sh (`make
# fetch-corpora`) and are not committed: sources.lock records the sha256
# of the one each model was built from, and every refresh release
# attaches them. (Until 2026-11-08 the nine oldest — en de fr es it nl pt
# sv pl — were tracked; they are in history up to that point.)
#
# NOTE the leading path: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this
# file, so a bare `corpora/*.txt` would match only at the repo root and
# silently ignore nothing.
predict/corpora/*.txt
predict/corpora/*.part

# Cargo build output, and the pack manifests `make packs` writes.
/target/
/dist/
